# Skill: Code Review — {{ project_name }}

## Purpose
Standard code review workflow. Run when reviewing a PR, diff, or file before merge.

## Steps

1. Load `CLAUDE.md` (root) and the relevant sub-module `CLAUDE.md` if applicable
2. Check adherence to conventions defined in `CLAUDE.md` and `AI_DIRECTIVES.md`
3. Verify no protected paths were touched without hook acknowledgment
4. Check for hardcoded secrets, env values, or debug flags
5. Confirm tests exist for all new behavior
6. Check for schema changes missing a migration
7. Flag anything warranting a new ADR in `docs/decisions/`
8. Verify `CHANGELOG.md` was updated if significant change

## Output Format

```
PASS:  [item] — note
WARN:  [item] — what to watch
BLOCK: [item] — must fix before merge
```

